missing-library,agent-optional,bench,plugin\",\n    \"source\": {\n      \"doc\": \"authored+verified on a disposable, session 2026-08-10, branch claude/newbound-missing-library-fixes-bx9bs0 (newbound: security.security.init, app.app.read, app.app.exec, dev.dev js, app.store js)\"\n    },\n    \"confidence\": \"high\",\n    \"time\": 1786365273284\n  },\n  {\n    \"claim\": \"app.store exports ensureConnected(): a single-flight same-origin connect (saved same-origin live config wins) that store-consuming controls call before store use.\",\n    \"detail\": \"Moved from app.loader's mount path during the bench collapse so controls carry no ambient boot-environment dependency. dev.jump (search), dev.session (run) and app.sceneplayer call it. Throws when the platform is unreachable.\",\n    \"tags\": \"bench-collapse\",\n    \"confidence\": \"high\",\n    \"time\": 1786399738682\n  },\n  {\n    \"claim\": \"Vendored ES bundles live at /app/asset/<lib>/vendor/... — nb_codemirror/cm6.js under dev, nb_three (scenestage.js, three.module.js) under app — and stock controls import them with page-relative dynamic import('../app/asset/...').\",\n    \"detail\": \"A module loaded from its real URL resolves its own internal relative imports natively, so no rewriting machinery is needed; blob-URL modules were the only reason the loader rewrote specifiers. The nb.js/store client still fetches against location.origin (tunnel-blind) — a known follow-up now fixable in one place.\",\n    \"tags\": \"bench-collapse\",\n    \"confidence\": \"high\",\n    \"time\": 1786401039423\n  },\n  {\n    \"claim\": \"The 17 author-taking dev.code commands declare nn_sessionid (platform-injected on all web calls) and default an empty author to the session user; set_module_flag no longer exists.\",\n    \"detail\": \"Browser clients pass author:\\\"\\\" — journals record the real session displayname. CLI/MCP callers pass author explicitly (provenance names like \\\"claude\\\") AND nn_sessionid:\\\"\\\